sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as HTTP Handler
    participant S as URL Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant B as Base62

    C->>H: POST /v1/urls
    H->>S: CreateURL(request)

    S->>S: Validate URL
    S->>S: Validate expiration
    S->>S: Validate custom alias

    S->>DB: INSERT URL
    DB-->>S: BIGSERIAL ID

    S->>B: Encode ID
    B-->>S: Short code

    S-->>H: URL result
    H-->>C: 201 Created